Copyright © 2026 Miguel Sedek.

These assets — the OpenHub mark, application icon and installer artwork — are
original work created for OpenHub and are released under the same terms as the
source code: MIT OR Apache-2.0, at your option. See LICENSE-MIT and
LICENSE-APACHE at the repository root.

They are provisional: a placeholder identity meant to keep the build and the
packaging honest until a designed mark replaces them.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Note on the upstream brand assets

OpenHub derives from OpenLogi (https://github.com/AprilNEA/OpenLogi). The
OpenLogi logo, application icon and design materials that originally lived in
this directory are © 2026 AprilNEA, all rights reserved, and are NOT covered by
the MIT/Apache licenses that cover the OpenLogi source code. Their license
explicitly withholds permission to use them to identify or represent forks or
derived projects.

Every one of those files has been replaced with the original artwork described
above. No OpenLogi brand asset is distributed by this repository. They remain
present in the imported git history, which is preserved for authorship and
license-compliance reasons; they are not used, shipped, or displayed by any
build produced from this tree.
